  "reading": {
   "title": "Emre is sick",
   "text": "Today Emre is sick. He has a fever and a bad cough. His throat hurts, too. Hafsa calls Dr. Lee's office. The receptionist says, \"We have an appointment at 4:00 today.\"\n\nAt 3:45, Hafsa and Emre are at the office. Hafsa has her insurance card in her bag. The receptionist takes the card and writes Emre's name.\n\nThen Dr. Lee asks, \"Emre, do you have a headache?\" \"No, I don't,\" Emre says. \"But my stomach hurts a little.\" Dr. Lee says, \"You don't have a serious problem. Take this medicine and drink water. You have school on Monday.\" Emre is happy, and Hafsa is happy, too.",
   "glossary": [
    {
     "en": "receptionist",
     "tr": "resepsiyon görevlisi"
    },
    {
     "en": "bag",
     "tr": "çanta"
    },
    {
     "en": "serious",
     "tr": "ciddi"
    },
    {
     "en": "a little",
     "tr": "biraz"
    }
   ],
